ojection.\nReplace the actor roster tautology with decoded membership assertions.\n\nRun the existing performance workload in release mode. Reuse the fully\nvalidated immutable standard content registry only for the exact canonical\nempty registry, preserving dynamic merge semantics and copy-on-write state.\nRetain the unchanged performance budgets and all ten CI matrix executions.\n\nPreserve Chinese product display names while using the supported Windows WiX\nzh-CN locale and an ASCII Linux technical package name with a Chinese desktop\ntemplate. Keep macOS identity and all default bundle targets.\n\nCurrent-main validation: workspace6894/0/77, frontend163/typecheck, real TCP\n301 commands and reconnect, release budgets51/0/46/20us all pass, conformance,\ncross-target hashes, fresh legacy WASM, Worker82 and external Vite products.\nIndependent combined review found no new P1/P2. Final full preflight21/21 and\npost-documentation checks passed. Warnings, ignored tests, original failures\nand first real GitHub run41053688083's5/10 failures remain recorded.\n\nRecord user decision26 approving the separately reviewed C331 schema4\ncompatibility supplement; no schema4/C331 implementation is included here.\nEvidence: docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-30-native-ci-corrections/\nActual corrected Windows/Linux CI, installers and platform execution remain\npending. WASM remains default and the overall convergence goal remains open.","timestamp":"2026-10-30T15:31:32Z","author":{"name":"ruyimg","email":"2689302609@qq.com"},"committer":{"name":"ruyimg","email":"2689302609@qq.com"}},"repository":{"id":1269455162,"node_id":"R_kgDOS6pZOg","name":"RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified","full_name":"RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified","private":false,"owner":{"login":"RuyimgByCN","id":45452808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NDUyODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45452808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RuyimgByCN","html_url":"https://g